    {
      "id": "glp-1",
      "name": "Semaglutide",
      "aliases": [],
      "kind": "product",
      "identityStatus": "resolved",
      "categoryID": 2,
      "benefits": "Human benefits are established for approved semaglutide formulations: weight loss and long-term weight maintenance; improved blood-glucose control in adults with type 2 diabetes; and fewer major cardiovascular events in specified high-risk populations. Ozempic also lowers kidney-disease progression and cardiovascular-death risk in adults with type 2 diabetes and chronic kidney disease. Wegovy injection has accelerated approval for noncirrhotic MASH with moderate-to-advanced fibrosis. Benefits depend on the product, route, indication, and population; they do not establish equivalence of every compounded formulation."
    }
  ],
